{"id":51569,"date":"2026-06-03T07:51:02","date_gmt":"2026-06-03T06:51:02","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-do-funchal-2\/"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:36:58","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:36:58","slug":"maratona-do-funchal","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-do-funchal\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona do Funchal 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona do Funchal 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona do Funchal 2027<\/strong> (<em>Funchal Marathon<\/em>) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>31 de Janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, na capital cosmopolita da <strong>Ilha da Madeira<\/strong>. Organizada pela <strong>AARAM (Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo da Regi\u00e3o Aut\u00f3noma da Madeira)<\/strong>, a prova possui percursos certificados pela <strong>World Athletics<\/strong> e pela <strong>AIMS<\/strong>, atraindo milhares de maratonistas de dezenas de nacionalidades para correr sob o clima ameno de inverno do arquip\u00e9lago atl\u00e2ntico.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e meta instaladas na prestigiada <strong>Avenida S\u00e1 Carneiro \/ Pra\u00e7a do Povo<\/strong>, a prova rainha de <strong>Maratona (42,195 km)<\/strong> e a <strong>Meia Maratona (21,097 km)<\/strong> partem \u00e0s <strong>08h00<\/strong>, seguindo-se a <strong>Mini Maratona e Caminhada (8 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>08h30<\/strong>. O tra\u00e7ado decorre ao longo da fant\u00e1stica marginal mar\u00edtima e da zona hoteleira da Estrada Monumental, oferecendo um percurso r\u00e1pido, vista deslumbrante sobre a ba\u00eda do Funchal, medalha comemorativa de luxo e festa de encerramento.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">31 de Janeiro de 2027 \u00e0s 08:00<\/span><\/l